  "releaseNotes": "refactor(http): replace StorageData with inline u8 literals and optimize models\n\n      - Fully eliminate StorageData dependency in HttpModel, RequestModel, and ResponseModel in favor of inline u8 literals and string constants.\n      - Inline static MimeTable using Utf8Map<string> and StatusPhrases dictionary.\n      - Clean up redundant AggressiveInlining attributes on properties and trivial methods.\n      - Update RequestModel and ResponseModel builders to write UTF-8 literals directly to buffer.",
